      "content": "It sounds incredibly draining to feel this deep emptiness when everything on the surface seems perfect. This feeling of \"nothingness\" is a very real experience, even when life looks successful from the outside. Since this fog is persistent and exhausting, it might be very helpful to explore this feeling with a mental health professional. They can provide tools and support to help you navigate these complex emotions.",
